---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { celebrityStories } from '../data/celebrity-stories.mjs';
import { url } from '../lib/paths';
---
<Layout title="Celebrities who don't wear fragrances? The source behind the story | CleanCare" description="A source-linked mosaic of celebrity interviews about perfume, scent and personal choices—with dates and important distinctions.">
<section class="container section celebrity-page"><p class="eyebrow">People, perspectives & personal choices</p><h1>Celebrities who don’t wear fragrances?</h1><p class="intro">Behind a headline is a person—and a little more context. Explore what these interviews actually say about perfume, scented products and personal routines.</p>
<p class="notice">These are dated personal statements, not medical advice or endorsements. “No perfume” does not necessarily mean fragrance-free: oils, body wash and candles can still be scented.</p>
<div class="celebrity-mosaic">{celebrityStories.map(person => <a class="celebrity-tile" href={person.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div class="celebrity-image"><img src={person.local ? url(person.image) : person.image} alt={person.name + ' pictured in the source interview'} loading="lazy" width="800" height="650" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"/></div><div class="celebrity-copy"><p class="eyebrow">{person.publisher}</p><h2>{person.name}</h2><p>{person.text}</p><span class="text-link">Read or watch the interview ↗</span><small>Image: {person.credit}</small></div></a>)}</div>
<div class="social-reading"><h2>Continue the conversation</h2><p>These supplied social links may require sign-in. Their speakers and content have not been verified, so they are not labelled as doctor-led or used as health evidence.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/discover/celebrities-who-doesnt-wear-fragrances">Explore the TikTok discovery page ↗</a> — a discovery feed, not a verified celebrity list.</li><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DSGwsz9juVP/">Open the first shared Instagram reel ↗</a></li><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWXCJPwDdp_/">Open the second shared Instagram reel ↗</a></li></ul></div>
<p class="editorial-note">Images remain owned by their respective publishers. Personal stories can start a conversation; check the <a href={url('evidence/')}>evidence library</a> for health guidance.</p></section>
</Layout>
<style>
 .celebrity-page h1{font-size:clamp(34px,4.8vw,64px);max-width:850px}.celebrity-mosaic{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-block:32px}.celebrity-tile{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;background:white;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s}.celebrity-tile:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 12px 30px #7a9a8b20}.celebrity-image{height:330px;overflow:hidden}.celebrity-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.celebrity-tile:nth-child(2) .celebrity-image{height:390px}.celebrity-copy{padding:24px}.celebrity-copy h2{font-size:28px;margin:8px 0}.celebrity-copy p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}.celebrity-copy small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px}.social-reading{padding:28px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--accent-sky)}.social-reading p,.social-reading li{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}.social-reading a{font-weight:600}.social-reading li{margin-top:10px}
 @media(max-width:720px){.celebrity-mosaic{grid-template-columns:1fr}.celebrity-image,.celebrity-tile:nth-child(2) .celebrity-image{height:290px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.celebrity-tile{transition:none}.celebrity-tile:hover{transform:none}}
</style>
